  "description": "The FCB ORIGIN is equipped with reliable and efficient components that require minimal maintenance. It's ideal for getting around town and taking on rough roads without a second thought.\n• TEKTRO HD-R280 brakes are powerful and consistent for safe riding regardless of the road surface conditions.\n• The SRAM Apex 11-speed single chainring drivetrain is designed to be as easy as possible to use and maintain. Its 11- to 42-tooth gearing makes climbing easier.\n• ALEXRIMS wheels are renowned for their reliability. They are paired with 45mm MAXXIS Rambler tyres. They offer incredible Grip and comfort thanks to their versatile design and large volume. The set is tubeless ready to offer more puncture protection and optimal performance.",
